#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:2
#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:108
msgid "Extending LMCache"
msgstr "扩展 LMCache"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"LMCache is designed to be extensible, allowing integration of custom "
"functionality without modifying the core. The main extension mechanisms "
"are:"
msgstr "LMCache 设计为可扩展的，允许在不修改核心代码的情况下集成自定义功能。主要的扩展机制有："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"**External Storage Backend Framework** – integrate new storage backends "
"(custom cache storage modules) via a standardized interface."
msgstr "**外部存储后端框架** – 通过标准化接口集成新的存储后端（自定义缓存存储模块）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"**External Remote Connector Framework** – integrate new remote KV store "
"connectors for external/distributed storage systems."
msgstr "**外部远程连接器框架** – 为外部/分布式存储系统集成新的远程 KV 存储连接器。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Plugin Framework** – run custom scripts as separate processes alongside"
" LMCache for added functionality."
msgstr "**插件框架** – 将自定义脚本作为独立进程与 LMCache 并行运行以添加功能。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:34
msgid ""
"**External Storage Backends** (bottom section of diagram) enable LMCache "
"to interface with new storage or transport systems. Developers can "
"implement the standardized ``StorageBackendInterface`` to create a custom"
" storage backend module. Such external backends are loaded by LMCache at "
"runtime (via configuration) in addition to the built-in backends that "
"ship with LMCache. Built-in backends include in-memory CPU caching, local"
" disk storage, NVIDIA NIXL (GPU peer-to-peer), and remote stores like "
"Redis, InfiniStore, Mooncake, etc."
msgstr ""
"**外部存储后端**（图表底部部分）使 LMCache 能够与新的存储或传输系统进行交互。开发人员可以实现标准化的 "
"``StorageBackendInterface`` 来创建自定义存储后端模块。这些外部后端在运行时由 LMCache 加载（通过配置），作为 "
"LMCache 自带的内置后端的补充。内置后端包括内存 CPU 缓存、本地磁盘存储、NVIDIA NIXL（GPU 点对点）以及 "
"Redis、InfiniStore、Mooncake 等远程存储。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:36
msgid "To add an external backend, you need to:"
msgstr "要添加外部后端，您需要："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Implement** a Python class inheriting from the LMCache "
"``StorageBackendInterface``, overriding all required methods."
msgstr "**实现**一个继承自 LMCache ``StorageBackendInterface`` 的 Python 类，覆盖所有必需的方法。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:39
msgid ""
"**Install** this backend package in the LMCache environment (so that "
"LMCache can import it)."
msgstr "**安装**此后端包到 LMCache 环境中（以便 LMCache 可以导入它）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Configure** LMCache to use it by adding an entry to the "
"`external_backends` list and specifying the module path and class name in"
" the configuration’s `extra_config`. For example:"
msgstr ""
"**配置** LMCache 使用它，方法是在 `external_backends` 列表中添加一个条目，并在配置的 "
"`extra_config` 中指定模块路径和类名。例如："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:49
msgid ""
"Multiple external backends can be enabled simultaneously. They are "
"initialized during LMCache startup. Note that the order of backends can "
"matter: if multiple backends are used, earlier listed backends have "
"higher priority for cache lookups (i.e. LMCache will check those backends"
" first when retrieving KV entries)."
msgstr ""
"可以同时启用多个外部后端。它们在 LMCache "
"启动期间初始化。请注意，后端的顺序可能很重要：如果使用多个后端，列表中靠前的后端在缓存查找时具有更高的优先级（即 LMCache 在检索 KV "
"条目时会首先检查这些后端）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"**External Remote Connectors** (middle section of diagram) allow "
"LMCache’s remote storage layer to connect to new external KV storage "
"systems. The LMCache `RemoteBackend` uses connector implementations to "
"communicate with various external stores. For example, built-in "
"connectors exist for Redis, InfiniStore, and MooncakeStore. To extend "
"LMCache with a new remote connector, you should:"
msgstr ""
"**外部远程连接器**（图表中间部分）允许 LMCache 的远程存储层连接到新的外部 KV 存储系统。LMCache 的 "
"`RemoteBackend` 使用连接器实现来与各种外部存储通信。例如，内置连接器包括 Redis、InfiniStore 和 "
"MooncakeStore。要使用新的远程连接器扩展 LMCache，您应该："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Implement** a class following LMCache’s remote connector interface "
"(similar to existing connectors). This typically involves subclassing the"
" `RemoteConnector` base and providing methods to connect, put, get, etc.,"
" for your storage system."
msgstr ""
"**实现**一个遵循 LMCache 远程连接器接口的类（类似于现有连接器）。这通常涉及继承 `RemoteConnector` "
"基类并为您的存储系统提供连接、put、get 等方法。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Expose** your connector for dynamic loading. Each remote connector is "
"associated with a URI scheme in the `remote_url`. For instance, if you "
"create a connector for a new storage called “FooStore” with scheme "
"`foo://`, you will want LMCache to use your class whenever a remote URL "
"starts with `foo://`."
msgstr ""
"**公开**您的连接器以供动态加载。每个远程连接器都与 `remote_url` 中的 URI "
"方案关联。例如，如果您为名为\"FooStore\"的新存储创建了一个方案为 `foo://` 的连接器，您希望 LMCache 在远程 URL "
"以 `foo://` 开头时使用您的类。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Configure** LMCache to recognize and load the connector. In recent "
"versions, LMCache supports dynamic loading of external connectors via "
"configuration. For example, you might include in `extra_config`:"
msgstr ""
"**配置** LMCache 以识别和加载连接器。在最新版本中，LMCache 支持通过配置动态加载外部连接器。例如，您可以在 "
"`extra_config` 中包含："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:63
msgid ""
"With this configuration, when LMCache sees a `remote_url` like "
"`foo://...`, it will import and use the `FooStoreConnector` class for "
"remote operations."
msgstr ""
"通过此配置，当 LMCache 看到类似 `foo://...` 的 `remote_url` 时，它将导入并使用 "
"`FooStoreConnector` 类进行远程操作。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:65
msgid ""
"By implementing a custom connector and configuring it as above, you can "
"integrate new remote backends (databases, distributed KV stores, etc.) "
"without changing LMCache’s core code. The `RemoteConnector` interface "
"typically handles connection setup, data serialization, read/write "
"operations, and error handling for the external store."
msgstr ""
"通过实现自定义连接器并如上所述进行配置，您可以在不更改 LMCache 核心代码的情况下集成新的远程后端（数据库、分布式 KV "
"存储等）。`RemoteConnector` 接口通常处理外部存储的连接设置、数据序列化、读/写操作和错误处理。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:67
msgid ""
"**Plugin Framework** (top section of diagram) allows running custom "
"scripts alongside LMCache processes. A plugin is launched as a separate "
"subprocess by LMCache’s plugin launcher. Plugins can target specific "
"LMCache roles – the scheduler (controller), worker processes, or all "
"nodes – depending on their filename. They can be written in Python, Bash,"
" or other scripting languages, and are useful for tasks such as logging "
"and metrics, custom cache management policies, health checks, or "
"integration with external systems."
msgstr ""
"**插件框架**（图表顶部部分）允许在 LMCache 进程旁边运行自定义脚本。插件由 LMCache "
"的插件启动器作为独立子进程启动。插件可以针对特定的 LMCache 角色——调度器（控制器）、工作进程或所有节点——取决于其文件名。它们可以用 "
"Python、Bash 或其他脚本语言编写，适用于日志记录和指标、自定义缓存管理策略、健康检查或与外部系统集成等任务。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:69
msgid "Key points and usage of the plugin system:"
msgstr "插件系统的关键点和用法："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:71
msgid ""
"**Configuration:** You can enable plugins via environment variables and "
"the LMCache config file. Set the `plugin_locations` in your YAML config "
"to point to directories containing plugin scripts. For example:"
msgstr ""
"**配置：**您可以通过环境变量和 LMCache 配置文件启用插件。在 YAML 配置中设置 `plugin_locations` "
"以指向包含插件脚本的目录。例如："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:79
msgid "At runtime, LMCache will scan these directories for plugin files."
msgstr "在运行时，LMCache 将扫描这些目录以查找插件文件。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Environment Variables:** LMCache provides context to plugins through "
"env vars: - `LMCACHE_PLUGIN_ROLE`: the process role (e.g. `SCHEDULER` or "
"`WORKER`) in which the plugin is running. - `LMCACHE_PLUGIN_CONFIG`: a "
"JSON string for any plugin configuration passed through LMCache. - "
"`LMCACHE_PLUGIN_WORKER_ID`: the ID of the current worker (if running on a"
" worker). - `LMCACHE_PLUGIN_WORKER_COUNT`: total number of worker "
"processes in the LMCache cluster."
msgstr ""
"**环境变量：**LMCache 通过环境变量向插件提供上下文：- `LMCACHE_PLUGIN_ROLE`：插件运行所在的进程角色（例如 "
"`SCHEDULER` 或 `WORKER`）。- `LMCACHE_PLUGIN_CONFIG`：通过 LMCache 传递的任何插件配置的 "
"JSON 字符串。- `LMCACHE_PLUGIN_WORKER_ID`：当前工作进程的 ID（如果在工作进程上运行）。- "
"`LMCACHE_PLUGIN_WORKER_COUNT`：LMCache 集群中工作进程的总数。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:87
msgid ""
"**Naming Conventions:** Plugin filenames determine where they execute: - "
"Files prefixed with **`scheduler_`** run only on the scheduler process. "
"*(Example: `scheduler_metrics.py` runs on the scheduler only.)* - Files "
"prefixed with **`worker_`** run on worker processes. If a numeric worker "
"ID is included (e.g. `worker_0_health.sh`), the plugin runs only on that "
"specific worker. If no ID is included (e.g. `worker_logcollector.py`), "
"the plugin will run on **all** workers. - Files prefixed with **`all_`** "
"(or any file without a role prefix) run on all LMCache processes (both "
"the scheduler and every worker). *(Example: `all_monitor.sh` runs on "
"every LMCache node.)* - Role names in filenames are case-insensitive. "
"Ensure worker ID (if specified) is numeric and part of the filename (with"
" underscores separating, e.g. `worker_2_custom.py` has three parts, which"
" targets worker ID 2 specifically)."
msgstr ""
"**命名约定：**插件文件名决定了它们的执行位置：- 以 **`scheduler_`** "
"为前缀的文件仅在调度器进程上运行。*（示例：`scheduler_metrics.py` 仅在调度器上运行。）*- 以 **`worker_`**"
" 为前缀的文件在工作进程上运行。如果包含数字工作进程 ID（例如 "
"`worker_0_health.sh`），则插件仅在该特定工作进程上运行。如果不包含 ID（例如 "
"`worker_logcollector.py`），则插件将在**所有**工作进程上运行。- 以 **`all_`** "
"为前缀的文件（或任何没有角色前缀的文件）在所有 LMCache 进程上运行（包括调度器和每个工作进程）。*（示例：`all_monitor.sh`"
" 在每个 LMCache 节点上运行。）*- 文件名中的角色名称不区分大小写。确保工作进程 "
"ID（如果指定）是数字并且是文件名的一部分（使用下划线分隔，例如 `worker_2_custom.py` 有三个部分，专门针对工作进程 ID "
"2）。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:93
msgid ""
"**Execution Model:** When LMCache starts up, the `PluginLauncher` locates"
" and starts each plugin as a subprocess: 1. **Interpreter Selection:** "
"The plugin launcher checks the script’s shebang (e.g. `#!...`) to decide "
"which interpreter to use. If no shebang is provided, it falls back on the"
" file extension (``.py`` uses the default Python interpreter, ``.sh`` "
"uses Bash, etc.). 2. **Output Handling:** Stdout and stderr from the "
"plugin processes are captured by LMCache and logged with a prefix (the "
"plugin name), so plugin output appears in LMCache logs for easy "
"debugging/monitoring. 3. **Lifecycle:** Plugins are launched when the "
"LMCache process starts (if their naming indicates they should run in that"
" process). They will be automatically terminated when the parent LMCache "
"process exits, ensuring no orphan processes."
msgstr ""
"**执行模型：**当 LMCache 启动时，`PluginLauncher` 定位并将每个插件作为子进程启动：1. "
"**解释器选择：**插件启动器检查脚本的 shebang（例如 `#!...`）以决定使用哪个解释器。如果未提供 "
"shebang，则根据文件扩展名回退（``.py`` 使用默认的 Python 解释器，``.sh`` 使用 Bash 等）。2. "
"**输出处理：**插件进程的 stdout 和 stderr 被 LMCache 捕获并使用前缀（插件名称）记录，因此插件输出会出现在 "
"LMCache 日志中，方便调试/监控。3. **生命周期：**插件在 LMCache "
"进程启动时启动（如果其命名表明它们应该在该进程中运行）。当父 LMCache 进程退出时，它们将自动终止，确保不会有孤儿进程。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:98
msgid ""
"**Best Practices:** When writing plugins, consider the following "
"guidelines to ensure they work smoothly with LMCache: - Keep plugins "
"lightweight in terms of resource usage and startup time, so they don’t "
"slow down the LMCache process. - Use clear and descriptive filenames to "
"reflect their purpose. - Include proper error handling within your plugin"
" script to avoid unhandled exceptions causing issues. - Use a shebang "
"line at the top of the script for portability (so the correct interpreter"
" is invoked). - Validate any configuration input (from "
"`LMCACHE_PLUGIN_CONFIG` or elsewhere) before use. - If a plugin performs "
"lengthy operations, implement timeouts or periodic logging so you can "
"detect if it hangs, and ensure it does not block LMCache’s normal "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"**最佳实践：**编写插件时，请考虑以下指导原则以确保它们与 LMCache 顺利配合：- 保持插件在资源使用和启动时间方面轻量级，以免拖慢 "
"LMCache 进程。- 使用清晰且描述性的文件名以反映其用途。- 在插件脚本中包含适当的错误处理，以避免未处理的异常导致问题。- 在脚本顶部使用"
" shebang 行以提高可移植性（以便调用正确的解释器）。- 在使用前验证任何配置输入（来自 `LMCACHE_PLUGIN_CONFIG` "
"或其他地方）。- 如果插件执行冗长的操作，请实现超时或定期日志记录，以便检测是否挂起，并确保它不会阻塞 LMCache 的正常操作。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/index.rst:106
msgid ""
"Together, these extension points – custom storage backends, remote "
"connectors, and plugin scripts – let users tailor LMCache's functionality"
" and integrate with external systems in a modular, maintainable way."
msgstr "这些扩展点——自定义存储后端、远程连接器和插件脚本——共同使用户能够以模块化、可维护的方式定制 LMCache 的功能并与外部系统集成。"

